{% doc %}
  @prompt
    IMPORTANT:
    - Do NOT include the human/person shown in the reference image.
    - The section should be designed specifically for a plant nursery / plant e-commerce website.
    - All plant/product images must be selectable through Shopify's Theme Editor using image upload/picker options.
    - Do NOT hardcode image URLs.
    - Make the section fully responsive for desktop, tablet and mobile.
    
    SECTION LAYOUT:
    
    1. MAIN SECTION
    - Full-width horizontal section.
    - Use a soft warm cream/off-white background.
    - Add a subtle decorative abstract radial/sunburst shape in the background on the right side.
    - Keep the overall design clean, premium and modern.
    - Rounded corners where appropriate.
    
    2. PRODUCT CAROUSEL
    Create a horizontally scrollable product carousel on the left/middle area.
    
    Display 3 plant product cards at a time on desktop.
    
    Each product card should contain:
    
    TOP AREA:
    - Large product image.
    - Image must be selectable/uploadable from Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Image should automatically fit inside the image area without distortion.
    - Rounded top corners.
    - Bestseller badge at top-left.
    - Discount badge at top-right.
    
    PRODUCT DETAILS:
    - Small rating badge such as:
      ★ 4.8 | 440
    - Product title.
    - Short product description.
    - Current price.
    - Original price with strikethrough.
    - Discount percentage.
    - Circular dark-green Add to Cart icon/button at bottom-right.
    
    Example content:
    Product 1:
    Title: Peace Lily Plant
    Description: Stunning air-purifying plant
    Price: ₹299
    Original Price: ₹350
    Discount: 15% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 440
    
    Product 2:
    Title: Anthurium Red Plant
    Description: Long-lasting indoor plant
    Price: ₹699
    Original Price: ₹800
    Discount: 13% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 111
    
    Product 3:
    Title: Jade Mini Plant
    Description: Easy-care lucky succulent
    Price: ₹249
    Original Price: ₹300
    Discount: 17% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 414
    
    3. SHOPIFY CUSTOMIZATION OPTIONS
    
    In the Shopify Theme Editor, provide settings for each product card:
    
    - Product image upload/picker
    - Product title
    - Product description
    - Current price
    - Original price
    - Discount text
    - Bestseller badge ON/OFF
    - Bestseller text
    - Rating
    - Review count
    - Product link
    - Add to cart button
    - Card background color
    
    Allow at least 6 product cards to be added dynamically using Shopify blocks.
    
    Each block should have its own image picker.
    
    4. CAROUSEL FUNCTIONALITY
    
    - Desktop: show 3 cards.
    - Tablet: show 2 cards.
    - Mobile: show 1 card with part of the next card visible.
    - Add a circular dark-green right arrow button overlapping the carousel.
    - Add a left arrow as well, but keep it subtle.
    - Smooth horizontal sliding animation.
    - Touch/swipe support on mobile.
    - Do not use external carousel libraries.
    - Use lightweight JavaScript/CSS.
    - Infinite or smooth looping is preferred.
    - Disable arrows when there are no more slides if infinite looping is not used.
    
    5. DESIGN STYLE
    
    Use a premium nursery / botanical visual style.
    
    Colors:
    - Dark green: #1F5130
    - Yellow/golden accent: #FFD60A
    - Cream background: #FFF9E8
    - White product card: #FFFFFF
    - Muted gray for secondary text.
    
    Typography:
    - Product titles should have a slightly elegant serif style.
    - Descriptions and prices should use a clean modern sans-serif font.
    - Use responsive font sizes.
    
    6. IMAGE SETTINGS
    
    VERY IMPORTANT:
    Every product card must have a Shopify image picker.
    
    Example schema structure:
    
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "product_image",
      "label": "Plant Image"
    }
    
    The uploaded image should be displayed dynamically.
    
    Also provide an optional image picker for:
    - Background/decorative plant image
    - Optional promotional image
    
    Do NOT use the human image from the reference.
    
    7. HOVER EFFECT
    
    When the user hovers over a product card:
    - Slightly lift the card.
    - Add a subtle shadow.
    - Plant image should have a very subtle zoom effect.
    - Add-to-cart button can slightly scale.
    - Keep the animation smooth and premium.
    - Do not make the animation excessive.
    
    8. ADD TO CART
    
    The circular shopping-bag/cart button should work with Shopify's cart functionality.
    
    If the block is connected to a Shopify product:
    - Clicking the button should add the selected product to cart.
    - Use Shopify's product/variant information.
    - If necessary, provide a product selector in the Theme Editor.
    
    Provide:
    - Product selector
    - Variant support
    - Add-to-cart functionality
    
    9. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop:
    - 3 product cards visible.
    - Cards should have equal width.
    - Carousel occupies approximately 65–70% of the section.
    - Leave enough breathing space around the cards.
    
    Mobile:
    - One card visible at a time.
    - Horizontal swipe carousel.
    - Product cards should remain visually large.
    - Hide unnecessary decorative elements.
    - Keep prices and buttons easy to tap.
    - No horizontal page overflow.
    
    10. CODE REQUIREMENTS
    
    Generate a complete Shopify Online Store 2.0 section.
    
    Provide:
    - Liquid
    - HTML
    - CSS
    - JavaScript
    - Shopify schema
    The code must be placed in ONE Shopify section file.
    with "view all products" in all plant with button and links 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;background:{{ block.settings.background }};padding:clamp(32px,5vw,68px) 20px;overflow:hidden}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{max-width:{{ block.settings.content_width }}px;margin:auto}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:20px;margin-bottom:24px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{font:clamp(28px,3vw,40px)/1.15 Georgia,serif;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};margin:0}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__all{color:{{ block.settings.green }};border:1px solid {{ block.settings.green }};border-radius:30px;padding:10px 17px;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{display:flex;gap:18px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scroll-behavior:smooth;scrollbar-width:none;padding:4px 2px 14px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex:0 0 calc((100% - 36px)/3);min-width:0;border-radius:{{ block.settings.radius }}px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;scroll-snap-align:start;box-shadow:0 5px 20px #17271912;transition:transform .25s,box-shadow .25s}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 12px 25px #17271920}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image{aspect-ratio:1.15;position:relative;background:#f1efe6;overflow:hidden}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image img,.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image svg{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;transition:transform .4s}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover .ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image img{transform:scale(1.035)}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge{position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;background:{{ block.settings.green }};color:white;border-radius:30px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sale{position:absolute;top:12px;right:12px;background:{{ block.settings.gold }};color:#222;border-radius:30px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__details{padding:14px 15px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating{font-size:11px;background:#f2f5ed;color:#334238;border-radius:20px;padding:4px 8px;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:8px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__name{font:600 20px/1.2 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 6px;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__name a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc{font-size:13px;color:{{ block.settings.muted }};line-height:1.45;margin:0}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-top:13px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price{font-weight:750;color:{{ block.settings.green }};font-size:18px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare{font-size:12px;color:#737b75;text-decoration:line-through;margin-left:6px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart{width:42px;height:42px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:{{ block.settings.green }};color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart svg{width:19px;height:19px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrows{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:9px;margin-top:8px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow{width:40px;height:40px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:{{ block.settings.green }};color:white;display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:default}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow svg{width:18px;height:18px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__error{color:#9b1c1c;font-size:12px}@media(max-width:900px){.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex-basis:calc((100% - 18px)/2)}}@media(max-width:600px){.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding:34px 16px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex-basis:82%}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{gap:14px;margin-right:-16px;padding-right:18px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrows{display:none}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{scroll-behavior:auto}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card,.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image img{transition:none}}
{% endstyle %}
<plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner"><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head"><h2 class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>{% if block.settings.view_all_link != blank %}<a class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__all" href="{{ block.settings.view_all_link }}">{{ block.settings.view_all_label | escape }}</a>{% endif %}</div><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track" data-track>{% for product in block.settings.products %}<article class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card"><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image">{% if product.featured_image %}{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '360, 540, 720, 900', alt: product.title | escape }}{% else %}{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}{% endif %}{% if block.settings.show_badge %}<span class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge">{{ block.settings.badge_text | escape }}</span>{% endif %}{% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}<span class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sale">{{ product.compare_at_price | minus: product.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: product.compare_at_price | round }}% OFF</span>{% endif %}</div><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__details">{% if block.settings.rating_text != blank %}<span class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating">★ {{ block.settings.rating_text | escape }}{% if block.settings.review_count != blank %} | {{ block.settings.review_count | escape }}{% endif %}</span>{% endif %}<h3 class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__name"><a href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.title | escape }}</a></h3>{% if product.description != blank %}<p class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc">{{ product.description | strip_html | truncate: 90 | escape }}</p>{% endif %}<div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom"><div><span class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price">{{ product.price | money }}</span>{% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}<span class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>{% endif %}</div>{% assign variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant %}<button class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart" type="button" data-add="{{ variant.id }}" aria-label="Add {{ product.title | escape }} to cart" {% unless variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 8h16l-1 12H5L4 8Zm5 1V6a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button></div><p class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__error" data-error role="status" hidden></p></div></article>{% else %}<p>Select products in this block's settings to populate the carousel.</p>{% endfor %}</div><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrows"><button class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" type="button" data-prev aria-label="Previous products"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg></button><button class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" type="button" data-next aria-label="Next products"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg></button></div></div></plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(()=>{const tag='plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}';if(customElements.get(tag))return;class Plants extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.track=this.querySelector('[data-track]');this.prev=this.querySelector('[data-prev]');this.next=this.querySelector('[data-next]');if(!this.track)return;this.prev.addEventListener('click',()=>this.move(-1));this.next.addEventListener('click',()=>this.move(1));this.track.addEventListener('scroll',()=>this.update(),{passive:true});this.update();this.querySelectorAll('[data-add]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',async()=>{const error=button.closest('.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__details').querySelector('[data-error]');button.disabled=true;try{const response=await fetch('{{ routes.cart_add_url }}.js',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json','Accept':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({id:Number(button.dataset.add),quantity:1})});if(!response.ok)throw new Error('Could not add the plant to cart.');window.location.href='{{ routes.cart_url }}'}catch(e){error.textContent=e.message;error.hidden=false;button.disabled=false}}));this.ro=new ResizeObserver(()=>this.update());this.ro.observe(this.track)}disconnectedCallback(){if(this.ro)this.ro.disconnect()}move(d){const card=this.track.querySelector('.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card');if(card)this.track.scrollBy({left:d*(card.getBoundingClientRect().width+(parseFloat(getComputedStyle(this.track).gap)||0)),behavior:'smooth'})}update(){const end=this.track.scrollWidth-this.track.clientWidth;this.prev.disabled=this.track.scrollLeft<=2;this.next.disabled=this.track.scrollLeft>=end-2}}customElements.define(tag,Plants)})();</script>
{% schema %}
{"name":"Plant product carousel","settings":[{"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"Find your next favourite plant"},{"type":"product_list","id":"products","label":"Products","limit":12},{"type":"text","id":"view_all_label","label":"View all button label","default":"View all plants"},{"type":"url","id":"view_all_link","label":"View all link"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_badge","label":"Show bestseller badge","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"badge_text","label":"Bestseller text","default":"Bestseller"},{"type":"text","id":"rating_text","label":"Rating","default":"4.8"},{"type":"text","id":"review_count","label":"Review count","default":"440"},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"range","id":"content_width","label":"Content max width","min":900,"max":1600,"step":50,"unit":"px","default":1200},{"type":"range","id":"radius","label":"Card corner radius","min":8,"max":32,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":16},{"type":"color","id":"background","label":"Background","default":"#FFF9E8"},{"type":"color","id":"green","label":"Dark green","default":"#1F5130"},{"type":"color","id":"gold","label":"Golden accent","default":"#FFD60A"},{"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Text","default":"#14231A"},{"type":"color","id":"muted","label":"Secondary text","default":"#5B6660"}],"presets":[{"name":"Plant product carousel"}],"tag":null,"class":"plant-product-carousel"}
{% endschema %}